============================================

Host: Linux 7.0.0-1014-aws. The sections of 2026-10-18 ran on branch fac/demo-beta-presentation-bhshh before its rebase on develop: T041 and the first T042 run at 11a4b58b, T043 at 4c31ee69 (as its section says). The second T042 run, of 2026-10-20, at the end of this file, gives its own commit.
Terminal colour codes are removed from the outputs below.

