Run 1: Velero stopped, so the backup cannot finish

At 2026-10-18T23:00:30Z, 'kubectl -n styrmin scale deploy/velero --replicas=0' set the Velero server deployment to 0/0 before the run. The node-agent DaemonSet kept running; only the Velero server was stopped.
The setup does not need the Velero server: it creates the environment, assigns the backup storage location and deploys Infrahub and Semaphore. So the setup passed, and the run failed inside the backup step as quickstart section 5 intends. At 2026-10-18T23:06:03Z, when the step "Back up the whole environment" started, Velero was still at 0/0.
Styrmin created two Velero Backup objects at 2026-10-18T23:06:19Z. They stayed without a phase because no Velero server processed them, so the environment backup stayed IN_PROGRESS until the demo's 600 s backup wait ended.

Started 2026-10-18T23:02:39Z, ended 2026-10-18T23:16:07Z. Command: uv run invoke record --demo backup-restore. Exit code: 1.

