T042, second run (2026-10-20): all four demos on a fresh demo stack
-------------------------------------------------------------------

Branch fac/demo-beta-presentation-bhshh at 249fee29, rebased on develop at bb56eac9. The four demos are registered in backend/tests/e2e/demos/catalog.py. Since the rebase, the branch holds the fixes that demos 1 and 4 need: #372 (PR #535) and #530 (PR #531).
This run replaces the first T042 run above, which recorded demos 2 and 3 only.

Fresh demo stack

- 2026-10-20T14:06:53Z to 14:07:11Z, exit code 0: 'uv run invoke build'. It builds the Styrmin image registry.opsmill.io/opsmill/styrmin:latest from this commit. 'uv run invoke start' reuses any existing image with that tag, and other worktrees on this host build Styrmin images too, so the image was built again before the reset.
