Before the run, the br_netfilter module was loaded, helm/styrmin/charts/ held the chart dependencies, the Chromium build of Playwright 1.64 was installed and ffmpeg was at /usr/bin/ffmpeg. None of the three host problems of the first T042 run occurred.

