- During demo 4 (14:48:14Z to 14:58:24Z): at most 26,672 MiB used and at least 4,792 MiB available, both at 14:56:17Z. At that time ffmpeg was encoding the video of demo 4 ('Encoding demo-videos/4-clone.mp4' at 14:56:09Z) and the environments network-lab and network-lab-clone still ran.
- After the cleanup (14:58:17Z): 17,854 MiB used, 13,611 MiB available.
- Swap used was 0 MiB in every reading.

The highest use of the whole run was the one during demo 4. How much of the difference the two environments used, and how much other processes on the host used, was not measured.

